---
description: Layout rules
alwaysApply: true
---
- App shell with fixed nav and one main panel sized to 100dvh. No page-level vertical scrolling.
- Content that does not fit becomes tabs, steps, cards, or pagination.
- Phone (<768px): bottom nav. Larger: side nav.
- Must work from 360px wide to 3440px wide. Use extra width for side panels, not stretched content.
- Use safe-area insets for notched phones.
